    "note": "The first export has an empty permit, so it withholds the bytes of d1 (BUN-RED-4), and the device store keeps d1 without bytes. The delta export has no permit, so it does not withhold the digest, and it leaves the bytes out as a base digest. The new artifact d3 names the digest. Rule 3 of BUN-DLT-4 gives failed with bundle_incomplete, because the bytes are in neither the bundle nor the store."
